&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own the roadmap for a core part of Diligent’s governance,&amp;nbsp;risk&amp;nbsp;and compliance SaaS platform, shaping how senior leaders and boards collaborate,&amp;nbsp;communicate&amp;nbsp;and make decisions in a secure, modern way.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;turn customer problems and market insights into simple, impactful product experiences, and work closely with engineering, design, and go&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;market teams to bring them to life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
