&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for complex or at-risk engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of Solutions Architects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set performance expectations, coach to them, and own career development and succession planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PS leadership on hiring and capacity planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Services Strategy &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize delivery methodologies, tools, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve operational processes for efficiency, scalability, and predictability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cross-Functional Partnership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales, CS, Product, Engineering, and Support for a seamless customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales on strategic or complex opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Funnel customer feedback into product and services improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with PS leadership to evolve services packaging and pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
