&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end web solutions&lt;/strong&gt; — from modern UIs to backend services, APIs, and infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with design, brand, marketing, and content teams&lt;/strong&gt; to deliver seamless, performant experiences across web and mobile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop backend logic and APIs&lt;/strong&gt;, manage data flows, and implement systems that integrate with third-party platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize website performance&lt;/strong&gt; by applying best practices in front-end development, including lazy loading, and efficient asset management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and manage infrastructure using tools like &lt;strong&gt;Vercel,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;AWS, Cloudfront, Terraform, and CI/CD pipelines (e.g., CircleCI)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
